<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI Workflow Architect - Day 43</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-base: #0b0f19;
            --bg-surface: #151d30;
            --bg-card: #1e2942;
            --text-main: #f3f4f6;
            --text-muted: #9ca3af;
            --accent: #00f2fe;
            --accent-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #4facfe 100%);
            --accent-purple: #9d4edd;
            --border: #2e3d60;
            --success: #10b981;
            --warning: #f59e0b;
            --danger: #ef4444;
            --radius: 12px;
            --transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            scrollbar-width: thin;
            scrollbar-color: var(--border) var(--bg-base);
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-base);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Top Header Navigation */
        header {
            background-color: var(--bg-surface);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 1.25rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            background: var(--accent-gradient);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .header-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .btn {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            color: var(--text-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--accent-gradient);
            color: var(--bg-base);
            border: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            color: var(--bg-base);
            opacity: 0.9;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        /* Layout Architecture */
        .app-container {
            display: flex;
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Interactive Sidebar Navigation */
        .sidebar {
            width: 320px;
            background-color: var(--bg-surface);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            height: calc(100vh - 69px);
            position: sticky;
            top: 69px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .sidebar-title {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .step-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .step-item {
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .step-item:hover, .step-item.active {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.04);
        }

        .step-item.active {
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
        }

        .step-meta {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.25rem;
        }

        .step-number {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .step-name {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .step-status {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--border);
        }

        .step-item.completed .step-status {
            background: var(--success);
        }

        /* Central Workflow Workspace */
        main {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 3rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .hero-section {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .badge {
            background: rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.15);
            color: var(--accent-purple);
            padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.3);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        /* Section Cards */
        .stage-pane {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-out forwards;
        }

        .stage-pane.active {
            display: block;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .grid-two-col {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .grid-two-col {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .app-container {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .sidebar {
                width: 100%;
                height: auto;
                position: static;
            }
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--bg-surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 4px;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--accent);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        /* Tool Matrix Grid */
        .tool-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .tool-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .tool-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .tool-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .tool-name {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .tool-tag {
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .tool-desc {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        /* Prompt Studio */
        .prompt-box {
            background: #070a12;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.25rem;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "Fira Code", Consolas, Monaco, monospace;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .copy-btn {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0.75rem;
            right: 0.75rem;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: sans-serif;
        }

        .copy-btn:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
            border-color: var(--accent);
        }

        /* Structured Checklists & Matrices */
        ul.task-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        ul.task-list li {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        ul.task-list li::before {
            content: "⚡";
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .matrix-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .matrix-table th, .matrix-table td {
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .matrix-table th {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* Custom Interactive Workspace Elements */
        .notes-area {
            width: 100%;
            height: 120px;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            resize: none;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .notes-area:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--accent);
        }

        /* Execution Metrics panel */
        .metrics-bar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .metric-item {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.25rem;
        }

        .metric-label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .metric-value {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        /* Interactive Diagram/Decision Tree Blocks */
        .diagram-node {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px dashed var(--accent);
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Print Override styles */
        @media print {
            body { background: white; color: black; }
            header, .sidebar, .copy-btn, .notes-area, .btn { display: none !important; }
            main { max-width: 100%; padding: 0; }
            .stage-pane { display: block !important; page-break-after: always; }
            .card { border: 1px solid #ccc; background: white; }
            .prompt-box { background: #f5f5f5; color: #333; border: 1px solid #ccc; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Executive App Header Navigation -->
    <header>
        <div class="brand">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
            AI Workflow Architect Pro
        </div>
        <div class="header-actions">
            <button class="btn" onclick="window.print()">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9V2h12v7M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2M6 14h12v8H6z"/></svg>
                Print Blueprint
            </button>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="bookmarkCurrentStage()">Bookmark Stage</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Workspace Matrix Layer -->
    <div class="app-container">
        
        <!-- Reactive Control Center Sidebar -->
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <div class="sidebar-title">Pipeline Stages</div>
            <ul class="step-list">
                <li class="step-item active" onclick="switchStage(1)" id="step-1">
                    <div class="step-meta">
                        <span class="step-number">Stage 01</span>
                        <span class="step-name">API Spec Generation</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-status"></div>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item" onclick="switchStage(2)" id="step-2">
                    <div class="step-meta">
                        <span class="step-number">Stage 02</span>
                        <span class="step-name">Multi-Repo Scaffolding</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-status"></div>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item" onclick="switchStage(3)" id="step-3">
                    <div class="step-meta">
                        <span class="step-number">Stage 03</span>
                        <span class="step-name">Mock Data Orchestration</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-status"></div>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item" onclick="switchStage(4)" id="step-4">
                    <div class="step-meta">
                        <span class="step-number">Stage 04</span>
                        <span class="step-name">Local Environment Setup</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-status"></div>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item" onclick="switchStage(5)" id="step-5">
                    <div class="step-meta">
                        <span class="step-number">Stage 05</span>
                        <span class="step-name">Summary & Tech Stack</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-status"></div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </aside>

        <!-- Primary Presentation Context -->
        <main>
            <div class="hero-section">
                <span class="badge">Microservices Blueprint Engine</span>
                <h1 id="main-title">Microservices Architecture Mapping</h1>
                <p class="subtitle" id="main-subtitle">Automating your distributed system design from interface configuration to multi-container execution grids.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- STAGE 1: API SPEC DESIGN -->
            <div id="stage-1" class="stage-pane active">
                <div class="grid-two-col">
                    <div class="card">
                        <div class="card-title">🎯 Tactical Objectives</div>
                        <ul class="task-list">
                            <li>Deconstruct domain constraints into bounded system context patterns.</li>
                            <li>Formulate valid OpenAPI 3.1 specifications utilizing schema-first design.</li>
                            <li>Incorporate system-wide standard structural payload schemas across decoupled boundaries.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <div class="card-title">⏱️ Execution Guardrails</div>
                        <div class="metrics-bar">
                            <div class="metric-item">
                                <span class="metric-label">Est. Time</span>
                                <span class="metric-value">45 Mins</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="metric-item">
                                <span class="metric-label">Complexity</span>
                                <span class="metric-value">Medium</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">🛠️ Specialized Engineering Tools</div>
                    <div class="tool-grid">
                        <div class="tool-card">
                            <div class="tool-header"><span class="tool-name">Claude 3.5 Sonnet</span><span class="tool-tag">Primary</span></div>
                            <p class="tool-desc">Excellent context processing windows for formatting complex, highly nested schemas without encountering data structural drift.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tool-card">
                            <div class="tool-header"><span class="tool-name">Stoplight Studio</span><span class="tool-tag">UI/UX</span></div>
                            <p class="tool-desc">Provides rapid visual checking mechanisms and instant verification loops alongside generated definition specifications.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tool-card">
                            <div class="tool-header"><span class="tool-name">ChatGPT Plus</span><span class="tool-tag">Alt</span></div>
                            <p class="tool-desc">Effective utility for translating standard database schemas directly into formatted OpenAPI payload structures.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">🤖 Microservices Spec Engineering Prompt Studio</div>
                    <p class="tool-desc">Feed this prompt context to your primary LLM coordinator engine:</p>
                    <div class="prompt-box">
                        <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyPrompt(this)">Copy Prompt</button>
                        Act as an elite Principal Systems Architect. Design a valid OpenAPI 3.1 YAML specification for a production-tier distributed 'Order Management Service'. The domain context includes endpoints for POST /orders, GET /orders/{id}, and PATCH /orders/{id}/status. Ensure
